{"id":"prochee","lemma":"прочее","pos":"noun","rank":3224,"glosses":["the rest"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/55/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%87%D0%B5%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%87%D0%B5%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"прочего","plural":"прочие"},"examples":[{"text":"Я не такой, как все прочие.","en":"I'm not like everybody else.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[1,5,"one who claims to be…"]]},{"text":"Прочие студенты смеялись.","en":"The other students laughed.","words":[null,{"g":"student","l":"студент"},{"g":"to laugh","l":"смеяться"}]},{"text":"Настойчивость, помимо всего прочего, необходима для успеха.","en":"Perseverance is, among other things, necessary for success.","words":[{"g":"persistence"},{"g":"besides"},{"g":"in total, in all"},null,null,{"g":"for"},null]},{"text":"Вы преуспели там, где прочие потерпели неудачу.","en":"You've succeeded where others have failed.","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},null,{"g":"there"},{"g":"where"},null,null,null]}]}